{
  "manifestVersion": 1,
  "revision": 1,
  "name": "work-task",
  "description": "A unit of human follow-up work arising from a business event, held against an opaque subject envelope. Every field is managed: a task exists only through the work package's actions or its follow-up capability, and no client can create, forge or rewrite one. It has an explicit transition table (open -> completed, open -> cancelled; both terminal, no reopen in v1) and no assignee: there is no authenticated or secure assignment here. dueAt is evidence only -- nothing is scheduled, nothing fires, and no clock changes a status.",
